# EXTRACTED GAME DATA DOES NOT GO IN THIS REPOSITORY.
#
# replay_step.py reads AzerothCore .map tiles, which are extracted from a game
# client and are not ours to redistribute. They are also large: 11 tiles for
# the self-test, and the working set extracted for #316 was 356 tiles and 26 MB.
# README.md in this directory says where to get them and how to point the
# script at them.
#
# The default location is maps/ beside the script, so that is what is refused
# here, along with the tile and archive extensions wherever they land.
maps/
*.map
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.mmap
*.mmtile
*.vmtile
*.vmtree

# Importing replay_step rather than running it leaves one of these behind.
__pycache__/
